log (`settings_screen.dart`) missing `groupValue` and `onChanged` parameters, which left selection clicks inactive and prevented saving a region change. Also fixed widget test page transition timing and isolate completion handling in `adaptive_recommendation_settings_flow_test.dart` and `settings_off_region_test.dart`.\n- **PostHog Contacted Before Any Conse"}}}}}}